ee cash flow.","ROE of 12% comes mostly from margins and asset turnover rather than leverage (1.8x equity multiplier).","It spends 0.7% of revenue on R&D."],"hlth":["Leverage is conservative at 0.9x net debt to EBITDA ($26.7M of cash against $29.8M of debt), with interest covered 5.8x.","No distress or manipulation flags (Altman Z 3.4, in the safe zone).","Short-term liquidity is ample (current ratio 2.35).","Working capital ties up about 257 days of sales, a drag on cash generation."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at 11.2% over 3 years, 11.8% over 5 years and 8.7% over 10 years, and it has been lumpy (year-to-year swings of 20%).","At current returns, reinvesting 100% of profits supports about 5.5% a year of fundamental growth, enough to sustain growth.","Free cash flow has compounded 34.8% a year over five years.","Forward indicators: deferred revenue up 17%.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (1.0x, 3.6% of sales), a maintenance pace."],"own":["Insiders own 21.1%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 76%.","Shareholder yield is a modest 0.7% (0.8% in dividends).","The share count has grown 1.1% a year over five years, diluting existing holders."],"people":["With about 1,087 employees, each generates about $351K of revenue, in line with the Industrials median, and revenue has grown 2.3% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $8K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $1.3M (4x revenue per employee)."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":52,"head":"Watch: priced 33% above its $18.07 fair value, but that value is low-confidence and the price is inside its $13.06\u2013$25.34 range.","pros":["Revenue grew 11.8%/yr over 5y","Net debt/EBITDA 0.9x","Altman Z in the safe zone","P/E 11.4x vs sector 24.1x","1 analysts' mean target $30.00 (+24%)"],"cons":["Trades 33% above fair value of $18.07","ROIC 5.5% vs WACC 9.4%","P/FCF 38.2x vs sector 22.9x"],"flags":[],"need":["its composite (36) is below 39","no margin of safety","it earns less tha